<% page_title "Page not found" %>

<%# An address no route answers is the same "Oh No!" page as every other
    error (operator, 2026-10-11): it was upstream's own "Page not found"
    template, with an optional picture from a configured pool, so a
    signed-in viewer met a different page from the one a signed-out viewer
    (refused earlier by MembersOnly) got. The picture is the error page's
    own now (ErrorPagePicture). %>
<%= render layout: "static/oh_no" do %>
  <p>Details: There is nothing at this address.</p>
<% end %>
